  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ukraine Relief, Recovery, Reconstruction and Reform Trust Fund (URTF)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Multi-Donor Trust Fund for Ukraine Relief, Recovery, Reconstruction and Reform is to provide a coordinated financing mechanism to assist the Government of Ukraine to: (a) sustain its administrative and service delivery capacity and conduct relief efforts; and (b) plan and implement Ukraine&#x2019;s recovery and resilient reconstruction.</narrative>
  </description>
